      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Deferral of depreciation related to new WA AMI meters and the MDM system between the time of in-service and when they were included in rate base per WA Docket Nos. UE-170327 and UG-170328. Amortization is over remaining useful life, which is through 2033.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
